Subject: [PATCH] Exercise checkpoint fork rejection with valid Dogecoin Scrypt
 headers

Replace the inherited early-return Bitcoin header fixture with deterministic easy regtest Scrypt headers. Preserve all original accepted-chain, prior-checkpoint and exact-checkpoint fork rejection assertions, making this previously skipped Doged test executable.

